  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Behovsanalys Romer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Needs assessment Roma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Behovsanalys f&#xf6;r att l&#xe4;gga grunden f&#xf6;r kommande riktlinjer f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka integrationen av romer (&quot;zigenare&quot;) inom den generella populationen i Makedonien. Liknande behovsanalyser kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras i andra l&#xe4;nder i regionen med s&#xe4;rskilt anpassade  uppf&#xf6;ljningsaktiviteter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Needs assessment to lay the groundwork for a set of guidelines to increase the level of integration of Roms (&apos;Gypsies&apos;) in the general population of the Republic of Macedonia. Similar needs assessments will be conducted elsewhere in the region with follow-on activities designed accordingly.</narrative>
  </description>
